.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK SPRINT LIST"
.SH NAME
hamstik sprint list \- List sprints in a project
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik sprint list [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List sprints in a project
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
.TP
.B --limit
Maximum items per page (endpoint maximum is 100 or 200)
.TP
.B --cursor
Opaque continuation cursor
.TP
.B --all
Follow all pages
Choices: true, false
